{"version":1,"content":"<p>2026年遊戲大獎（The Game Awards，簡稱TGA）正式公佈年度獎項提名名單，Rockstar Games旗下備受期待的《俠盜獵車手6》（Grand Theft Auto VI，簡稱GTA 6）成功入圍年度遊戲（Game of the Year），並且一舉獲得八項提名，成為本屆提名數量最多的遊戲。特別之處在於，該作直到11月19日才正式發售，提名名單公佈時，普通玩家甚至還沒有機會購買和體驗這款遊戲。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1586892.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T06:47:02.551772+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":212,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T06:19:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T06:40:20.985839+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T06:40:20.985839+00:00","content_hash":"316956512290fe2ed0d1ffcd38e9f64ba7f924e2bf2ea96e75d078d7d7552c66","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}